{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34339","headline":"新秋月夕客有自远相寻者作吴体二首以赠 一 · 陆龟蒙","name":"新秋月夕客有自远相寻者作吴体二首以赠 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风初寥寥月乍满，杉篁左右供余清。\n因君一话故山事，忆鹤互应深溪声。\n云门老森定未起，白阁道士遥相迎。\n日闻羽檄日夜急，掉臂欲归岩下行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34339.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34339","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}